The '''Wizard Brawl''' is a sub-location of the {{Zone|Wizardman Bureau}}. It can be entered by challenging {{NPCSprite|Wizardman}} to the '''Wizard Brawl'''.

== Features ==
The '''Wizard Brawl''' features several quartz pillars that can be broken through explosions. Here, players can use the {{Item|Staff of the Rising Moon}}.

== Trivia ==
* The {{Item|Staff of the Rising Moon}} is a reference to the {{Item|Staff of the Rising Sun}}.

